__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
data/*.db
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
# data/processed/ is deliberately NOT ignored either: it holds the historical
# game tables the backtests read. Committing them stops a published result
# from resting on a sample that quietly re-downloads and shifts underneath it.
# data/snapshots/ is deliberately NOT ignored: live odds cannot be
# reconstructed after the fact, and the container is wiped between runs, so the
# committed CSVs are the only durable record. See storage/snapshots.py.
.env
